"\n"
"-  `Avoin.Systems <https://avoin.systems/>`__:\n"
"\n"
"   -  Nedas Żilinskas\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by the OCA.\n"
"\n"
